      "Coordinated activities and overall project management; oversaw work packages on internationalisation, equity, university management and IT infrastructure. Key activities: the new Study in Romania portal, the institutional development fund (FDI) and habilitation platforms, and data-management and visualisation modules for universities; a platform linking graduate data with the employment register and graduate-survey results; and a study on access, progression and completion policies. Member of the teams evaluating social policies in higher education.",
